  KEY PERFORMANCE INDICATORS (KPI)

 
A. Provide details of completed orders - average order value, total value and count 

1. WITH order_totals AS (
  SELECT o.order_id,
         SUM(oi.quantity * oi.unit_price) AS order_total
  FROM orders o
  JOIN order_items oi ON o.order_id = oi.order_id
  WHERE o.status = 'completed'
  GROUP BY o.order_id
)
Insight: There was a total revenue of completed orders of $1,779.74

2. SELECT COUNT(*) AS completed_orders,
       SUM(order_total) AS total_revenue,
       ROUND(AVG(order_total), 2) AS avg_order_value
  FROM order_totals;
Insight: There is an average order value of $148.31 and 12 orders
 
B. Revenue by product

SELECT p.product_name,
       SUM(oi.quantity)                 AS units_sold,
       SUM(oi.quantity * oi.unit_price) AS revenue
FROM order_items oi
JOIN orders o   ON oi.order_id   = o.order_id
JOIN products p ON oi.product_id = p.product_id
WHERE o.status = 'completed'
GROUP BY p.product_name
ORDER BY revenue DESC;

Insights: Stand Mixer is the top earner ($499.98 from just 2 units). The Mystery
Novel sells the most units (5) but earns only $74.95 because of its low price. 
This sales data shows that volume and revenue tell different stories. 
From the analysis, Stand Mixer is the top earner with $499.98 from just 2 units. 
The Mystery Novel sells the most units (5) but earns only $74.95 because of its low price
 
 
C. Find the monthly revenue with month-over-month growth

WITH monthly AS (
  SELECT CAST(DATE_TRUNC('MONTH', o.order_date) AS DATE) AS month,
         SUM(oi.quantity * oi.unit_price)                AS revenue
  FROM orders o
  JOIN order_items oi ON o.order_id = oi.order_id
  WHERE o.status = 'completed'
  GROUP BY 1
)
SELECT month,
       revenue,
       ROUND(100.0 * (revenue - LAG(revenue) OVER (ORDER BY month))
             / LAG(revenue) OVER (ORDER BY month), 1) AS mom_growth_pct
FROM monthly
ORDER BY month;

Insight: The monthly MOM are Feb -25.2%, Mar +45.5%, Apr -42.9%. 
March has only the peak value of $559.90, and this proves how volatile the revenue is, as just one large changed the month,

